meta {
  name: List Chat Messages
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{communicationBaseUrl}}:8124/?sessionId=session-1
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  sessionId: session-1
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
}

docs {
  functions-communication: ListChatMessages (port 8124). session-1 is
  pre-seeded (see seed/main.go seedCommunicationData) for shift-booked-1's
  participants (nursery-acorn, staff-jane), standing in for what
  onShiftBooked would have created — that Pub/Sub trigger doesn't fire
  locally (§7). Sign in as one of those two first.
}
